WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.100
I'm Andrew Smith
from Aleron.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.800
For more than 16 years we've been installing
passive fire protection on sites across the UK.

3
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.600
In that time we've seen how much demand
there is for skilled installers,

4
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:15.600
and how hard it is to get proper training
from people who actually do the work.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.100
That's why we created Aleron Academy:

6
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.700
to share our experience with people who
want to build a career in this field.

7
00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.450
You can start with our
online theory course.

8
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.950
The video lessons are filmed
on our own projects

9
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:30.300
and show, step by step,
how systems are installed,

10
00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.900
across different products,
manufacturers and technologies.

11
00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:35.850
If you want hands-on experience,

12
00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:39.000
the practical course lets you work
alongside our specialists,

13
00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.300
try the installation yourself,
see every detail up close

14
00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:43.800
and ask questions.

15
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.100
And the NVQ route adds a visit from
an independent assessor,

16
00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:50.600
leading to an industry-recognised
NVQ Level 2 qualification

17
00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:52.650
in passive fire protection.

18
00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:55.300
Choose your route and start today.

